  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulondela hayumiyi hinukutiya neyi izu datiyakana daluntu lwaluvulu mwiwulu, hiyakwila nawu, Aleluya! Wamwinu ni kulema niŋovu yambala yaNzambi yetu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwasompeshaŋayi mwalala mwaloŋa; muloŋa nasompeshi dehi chivumbi muneni watokeshelaŋa hanu hamaseki nawuvumbi windi. Nzambi natendi dehi mashi awambuŋindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwila kamuchiyedi nawu, Aleluya! Wishi windi wudi nakufwinda haya nyaka nanyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu awakulumpi makumi ayedi nawana, ninowu amomi awana, hiyakudinata chamesu heseki, hiyakudifukula kudi Nzambi washakamaŋa hetanda dawanta nawu, Amena! Aleluya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwitanda dawanta himukufuma izu nindi, Hamekenu Nzambi yetu, enu ambuŋindi ejima, enu mwa-mwakamaŋa, nianyanya niamaneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutiya izu didi neyi daluntu lwaluvulu, neyi kuvuma kwameji amavulu, neyi yivumina yaŋovu, nakwila nawu, Aleluya! Muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yetu, Watwesha yejima, hakuyula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuzaŋalalenu, tutiyenu kuwaha nankashi, tumulemeshenu; muloŋa kusumbula kwaKana kamukoku kunashiki dehi, niŋodindi nadiloŋeshi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakumwiteja mumbandowu kuvwala mahina amawahi atooka atamuka akadi hatama. Muloŋa mahina amawahi atooka hinyidimu yawakwakujila yaloŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Sonekaku neyi, Anatambikuwu kumawija aKana kamukoku anakooleki. Hakuŋila nindi, Wenawa diwu mazu aNzambi alala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukudinata chamesu heseki kunyendu yindi nami nidifukuli kudi yena. Hakuŋila nindi, Nehi, lekaku. Ami nimukwenu nduŋu neyi, ninduŋu hamu nawana kwetu ashimunaŋa Yesu; difukuli kudi Nzambi. Muloŋa kushimuna kwashimunaŋawu Yesu hispiritu yawuprofwetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumona mwiwulu munenzuluki dehi. Kutala hikudi kawalu katooka nimukwakwendelahu, anamuteni nawu, Washinshika, Walala. Wasompeshaŋa, waasaŋa njita mwaloŋa hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesu indi adi neyi chikwamuzuzu wakesi, kunamutu windi kudi yibaŋula yayivulu; wukweti ijina dakusoneka dehi, kwosi muntu wadilukaku chiŋa yomweni hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wavwala ihina dakwombeka mumashi; ijina dindi aditenaŋa nawu, Izu daNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Majita amwiwulu adi nakumulondela, adi nakwendela hatuwalu tutooka, anavwali mahina atooka akadi hatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukanwa kindi himukwidika mpoku yakabali yatwa, kulonda akatapi nachu nyuza; wakayiyula nambwechi yachikuŋu. Hakudata wukamwinu wavinyu yakulendumuka kwalendu mukaŋa kuzuwa kwaNzambi Watwesha yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hachikovwelu chindi nihekata dindi wukweti ijina dakusoneka nawu, Mwanta wawanyanta, Mukulumpi wawakulumpi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumona kaŋelu nemani mwitaŋwa. Hakubidika nezu datiyakana, hakuyila atujila ejima atúukaŋa hakachi kaluzwizu nindi, Inzenu mupompi kuchawija chaNzambi cheneni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mudyi mbiji yawanyanta ankanu, niyawawakulumpi anjita, niyawayilobu, niyawatuwalu nawakwakwendelahu, niyawantu ejima, hela abula wuduŋu hela anduŋu, hela anyanya hela amaneni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumona owu kanyama nianyanta ankanu ahanu hamaseki ninjita jawu, anapompi dehi hamu, akadasi njita nayenowu wudi nakwendela hakawalu, ninanjita yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu kanyama hiyakumukwatila hamu nakaprofwetu wakutwamba, owu wakoŋelaŋa yinjikijilu kumesu akanyama, yadimbilaŋayi nachu antu afundiluwu mufunda wanowu kanyama, adifukwilaŋa kumukishi windi. Mwayedi wawu hiyakuyumbila amomi mwijiya dakesi dabutukaŋa kesi kaNzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asheluhu hiyakuyŋahola nampoku yakabali yedikili mukanwa kayenowu wadiŋi nakwendela hakawalu. Atujila ejima hiyakwikuta mbiji yawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
